<title>PORTUGAL: Register lodged with CMVM in EDP sale.</title>
<headline>Register lodged with CMVM in EDP sale.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The definitive register in the first stage privatisation of state utility EDP-Electricidade de Portugal was lodged with the Financial Markets Committee (CMVM) after terms of the sale were announced, a source close to the process said.</p>
<p>&quot;The definitive register was lodged with the CMVM today after the details of the tranches to be sold were made public,&quot; the source said.</p>
<p>The government will sell some 30 percent of EDP's capital at a special session on Lisbon bourse on June 16.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
